@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@reservationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Availability and quote
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotel/disponibilidad?checkInDate=2030-06-01&checkOutDate=2030-06-04&roomType=SINGLE&season=HIGH

### Create reservation; copy data.id into reservationId above
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hotel/reservar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "roomId": 1,
  "checkInDate": "2030-06-01",
  "checkOutDate": "2030-06-04",
  "season": "HIGH",
  "guest": {
    "name": "Ana Pérez",
    "document": "123456",
    "email": "ana@example.com",
    "phone": "+57 3001234567"
  }
}

### Add service; also accepts SPA and TRANSFER
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/hotel/servicios/{{reservationId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"serviceType": "BREAKFAST"}

### Check in
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hotel/checkin/{{reservationId}}

### Reservation details
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/hotel/reserva/{{reservationId}}

### Check out and final invoice
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/hotel/checkout/{{reservationId}}
